const faqs = [
  {
    q: "Do I need to pay any advance while booking early, or can I pay after the trip?",
    a: "Zero advance payment is required! You can reserve your cab weeks or months in advance without paying anything today. No credit cards or Indian bank OTPs are needed during booking. You pay your chauffeur directly via Cash, UPI, or Card only after your ride is safely completed."
  },
  {
    q: "I am flying to Chennai from abroad (UK, USA, Europe, Singapore, Gulf, etc.). How does the booking and arrival pickup work?",
    a: "Booking from abroad is completely frictionless. Simply reserve with your flight number and WhatsApp contact (+44, +1, +65, +971, etc. are all supported). We track your flight on live radar for delays. When you land at Chennai Airport (MAA), your chauffeur is already waiting outside the arrival exit gate holding a personalized name-board placard and assists with heavy luggage. You pay post-trip, so there are zero foreign card transaction fees upfront."
  },
  {
    q: "Can international tourists pay in foreign currency (USD / EUR) or Bitcoin?",
    a: "Under Reserve Bank of India (RBI) and FEMA regulations, all local transport in India is legally settled in Indian Rupees (INR). Bitcoin and foreign cash notes are not accepted. International passengers can conveniently withdraw INR cash from 24/7 bank ATMs inside the Chennai Airport arrival terminal, exchange currency at the terminal Forex desks, or pay post-trip via UPI or International Card. Zero advance deposit is needed."
  },
  {
    q: "Can I book an early morning (3:00 AM – 5:00 AM) doorstep cab for an airport drop?",
    a: "Yes, early morning airport drops are our specialty. Your chauffeur details and car registration number are sent to you by 9:00 PM the evening before. Your assigned chauffeur arrives at your doorstep 20–30 minutes before the scheduled pickup time with 100% guaranteed punctuality and zero cancellations."
  },
  {
    q: "How fast can a cab pick me up at Chennai International Airport (MAA)?",
    a: "Our dispatch fleet is stationed directly in the airport perimeter corridor (Pallavaram / Guindy / Medavakkam belt). Cabs reach Terminal 1 (Domestic) and Terminals 2 & 4 (International) within 5 to 10 minutes flat, with zero terminal taxi queue waiting."
  },
  {
    q: "What happens if my arrival flight is delayed by several hours?",
    a: "Flight delays are never your fault. We track your flight in real time using your flight number. Whether your flight lands early or is delayed by 2, 4, or even 6+ hours, your chauffeur automatically adjusts your pickup time. Waiting time is completely free with zero delay penalty or hourly waiting fees."
  },
  {
    q: "Where does the chauffeur meet me for airport arrival pickups?",
    a: "For Terminal 1 (Domestic) and Terminals 2 & 4 (International), your chauffeur waits right outside the designated passenger arrival exit gate holding a personalized name board with your name, assists with your luggage, and escorts you directly to your clean AC cab."
  },
  {
    q: "Are the airport transfer rates fixed or subject to midnight/rain surge pricing?",
    a: "Our flat zone rates are 100% fixed for both airport pickups and airport drops. Rain, morning peak office hours, or midnight arrivals (1:00 AM – 4:00 AM) never change your flat agreed fare. Toll booth tickets and official airport parking receipts are billed transparently at exact actuals."
  },
  {
    q: "Can I book a direct highway transfer between MAA Airport and Pondicherry, Vellore, or Tirupati?",
    a: "Yes! Many tourists and travelers fly into MAA and immediately travel outstation, or need a direct highway pickup to catch a flight. We provide direct transfers to/from Pondicherry (₹3,900 flat), Tirupati Balaji (₹4,200 flat), and Vellore CMC (₹4,200 flat) with zero city center delay. For complete Balaji darshan yatras including return tolls and AP permits, check our all-inclusive <a href=\"/services/tirupati-package/\" class=\"text-m3-primary font-bold hover:underline\">Chennai to Tirupati Cab Package</a>."
  },
  {
    q: "Do you provide corporate GST invoices for company travel reimbursement?",
    a: "Yes. Kalidass Travels (GSTIN: 33COVPM0531D1Z4) provides 100% itemized GST tax invoices with your company name and GSTIN, making corporate expense claims and input tax credit claims seamless."
  }
];

